&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 운행회수 : 등 · 하교를 각각 <font color=\"#0000cd\"><u>38회(19대 왕복)</u></font> 운행(증 ·감</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 차 될&nbsp;수 있음)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 운행노선 : 첨부 자료 참조(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,255); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">추후 변경될 수 있음</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 후원금 :&nbsp; 정액권 330,000</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 후원금 납부기간 : 수시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;<font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font face=\"바탕체\">&nbsp;★ 통학버스 후원금</font></strong></font>&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(105,105,105); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"